# Text files are checked out with LF on every system, as they are kept: the
# build's checks compare generated files byte for byte and read sources line
# by line, and a Windows checkout's CRLF (core.autocrlf) failed them
# (2026-11-10). A file committed with CRLF stays as it is.
* text=auto eol=lf
web/src/locales/ko/_meta.json merge=union
# A source put out with git archive carries its commit and its time
# (internal/app/server_build.go).
internal/app/build_stamp/archive.txt export-subst
